      "html": "©️ 4. Intellectual property"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "The Caresse application, its brand, logo, interface, source code, and algorithms are the exclusive property of the publisher. Any reproduction, representation, modification, or exploitation, in whole or in part, without the prior written authorization of the publisher is prohibited and constitutes an infringement punishable under applicable intellectual property law."
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "⚠️ 5. Liability"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "The publisher endeavors to ensure the accuracy and currency of the information published within the application. It cannot be held liable for errors or omissions, nor for service unavailability caused by factors beyond its control (network outages, third-party maintenance, force majeure)."
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "Content generated by Artificial Intelligence is inherently unpredictable. The publisher cannot be held responsible for such content, as further detailed in the <a href=\"../cgu/\">Terms of Service</a>."
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "🔐 6. Personal data"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "The processing of users' personal data is described in the <a href=\"../privacy/\">Privacy Policy</a>. In accordance with the GDPR, any request relating to your data may be addressed to the publisher via the contact provided in Article 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "If your request is not resolved, you may contact your local data protection authority. EU users may contact the <strong>CNIL</strong> (France): <a href=\"https://www.cnil.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.cnil.fr</a>."
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "h2",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "⚖️ 7. Governing law"
    },
    {
      "type": "element",
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "html": "This legal notice is governed by French law. Any dispute relating to its interpretation or enforcement falls under the exclusive jurisdiction of the French courts."
